2026-07-27T08:16:34.6457432Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:16:34.6458109Z i /tmp/RtmpVPMb3h/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:16:34.6458442Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:16:34.6458839Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:16:34.6459427Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:16:34.6459983Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:16:34.6460794Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:16:34.6461414Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
